ABBAS KA DIL DUQTAR E SHABBIR SAKINA. <br>
HAI SABR KE QURAN KI TAFSEER SAKINA.<br>
<br>
1. BACHI KO MILA SHAAM E GHARIBAN SE SUKOON KAB. <br>
 JO ZULM HUWAY BAAD E SHAIHE KARBOBALA SAB. <br>
 MOUJOOD HAI RUQSAAR PA TEHREER SAKINA.<br>
<br>
2. BINTE SHAIHE MAZLOOM KI HIMMAT HAI ANOOKHI. <br>
 TOUHEED KI TA SHAAM NA KYUN JAYE TAJALLI.<br>
 HAI JURRAT E SHABBIR KI TANVEER SAKINA.<br>
<br>
3. AYUB KE BHI LAB PA MILI TERI KAHANI. <br>
 HAMSAR HAI TERA KOI NA KOI TERA SAANI. <br>
 ZEHRA KI HAI TOU BOLTI TASVEER SAKINA.<br>
<br>
4. BAAD E SHAIHE MAZLOOM NA TUKHKO MILA AARAM. <br>
 AATI NHI TOU KISTARAH TUJHE NEEND SARAY SHAAM. <br>
 BISTER THA TERA SEENAYE SHABBIR SAKINA.<br>
<br>
5. BIBI KE MASAEB KA TASAVVUR NAHI AASAN. <br>
 EHSAAS YE KEHTA HAI LIKHON SHAAM KA ZINDAAN. <br>
 ASHKOUN SE QALAM KARTA HAI TEHREER SAKINA.<br>
<br>
6. PHIR NAZR E KARAM KIJIYE ZAIR PE QUDARA. <br>
 ROUZE PA BULA LIJIYE JOUHER KO DUBARA. <br>
 AYE ABID E DILGEER KI HAMSHEER SAKINA.<br>
